                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Drive slow, slips in thick grass</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Cable out of adjustment or glazed belt</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Free to adjust; belt about $15 to $40</td>
                  </tr>
